(1283949, 164752, 93, '<td valign="top">The selective desat here is overdone.  Perhaps if it was just on the ball, but doing the whole player really doesn''t work for me.  Also, it''s a little *too* smooth (not insuating that you smoothed it artifically, just saying what I see) for me.. with B&amp;W action shots, texture can play a really important part.</td>', 'The selective desat here is overdone.  Perhaps if it was just on the ball, but doing the whole player really doesn''t work for me.  Also, it''s a little *too* smooth (not insuating that you smoothed it artifically, just saying what I see) for me.. with B&W action shots, texture can play a really important part.', '2005-04-11 11:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
