(1283954, 165125, 93, '<td valign="top">Like.. wow man.<br/>I look after a 7 year old that is beginning to learn moves like this in gymnastics, and what I wouldn''t give for a large enough background to capture her doing said moves without a cluttered and messy environment.  I''ve always been partial to this kind of photography.<br/> <br/>If you could PM me sometime and let me know what you used for a backdrop and lighting set-up, I''d very much appreciate it.</td>', 'Like.. wow man.I look after a 7 year old that is beginning to learn moves like this in gymnastics, and what I wouldn''t give for a large enough background to capture her doing said moves without a cluttered and messy environment.  I''ve always been partial to this kind of photography. If you could PM me sometime and let me know what you used for a backdrop and lighting set-up, I''d very much appreciate it.', '2005-04-11 11:07:36.000000', NULL, 1),
