(1284218, 165064, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is certain to win a ribbon.  Great shot and composition.  Good luck.</td>', 'This is certain to win a ribbon.  Great shot and composition.  Good luck.', '2005-04-11 14:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284220, 165197, 12578, '<td valign="top">Looks good without the motion blur yet I feel this would have much more impact had the shot have been shot using a ever so slighlty shutter speed to blur the rotors more. I presume the for the shot you couldn''t get around the front which is a shame as the trees kind of spoil the main focal point but overall a great capture.</td>', 'Looks good without the motion blur yet I feel this would have much more impact had the shot have been shot using a ever so slighlty shutter speed to blur the rotors more. I presume the for the shot you couldn''t get around the front which is a shame as the trees kind of spoil the main focal point but overall a great capture.', '2005-04-11 14:17:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284221, 165205, 12578, '<td valign="top">would like to see a little more water on the LHS and would have been more ''extreme'' had the shot of been taken with the jet bike going fast down the straight unless they were about to fall of then this would have had more impact. Great colour of the water mind.</td>', 'would like to see a little more water on the LHS and would have been more ''extreme'' had the shot of been taken with the jet bike going fast down the straight unless they were about to fall of then this would have had more impact. Great colour of the water mind.', '2005-04-11 14:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284224, 164601, 12578, '<td valign="top">A little too much contrast for my liking but great capture and nice overall cropping.</td>', 'A little too much contrast for my liking but great capture and nice overall cropping.', '2005-04-11 14:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284226, 165114, 12578, '<td valign="top">Good use of Selective colour and I really love teh expression on the catchers face.</td>', 'Good use of Selective colour and I really love teh expression on the catchers face.', '2005-04-11 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284231, 164436, 12578, '<td valign="top">Great usage of the AV setting to get that little bit of movement in the wheels to see the vehicle is in motion and keeping the overall image crisp yet I would prefer to see more of the car coming at me rather than away but probably couldn''t be helped due to where you were located on the sidelines... Great Shot.</td>', 'Great usage of the AV setting to get that little bit of movement in the wheels to see the vehicle is in motion and keeping the overall image crisp yet I would prefer to see more of the car coming at me rather than away but probably couldn''t be helped due to where you were located on the sidelines... Great Shot.', '2005-04-11 14:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1284232, 164285, 12578, '<td valign="top">Love this shot but I think that the motion blur is slightly too much for the speed that a bicycle would travel at. Good luck its a great image none the less :0)</td>', 'Love this shot but I think that the motion blur is slightly too much for the speed that a bicycle would travel at. Good luck its a great image none the less :0)', '2005-04-11 14:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
