(1284244, 165072, 12578, '<td valign="top">Sometimes You gotta go against the rules of photography and this is one that works well using this technique, shame theres no pilot but none the less a strikingly good image.</td>', 'Sometimes You gotta go against the rules of photography and this is one that works well using this technique, shame theres no pilot but none the less a strikingly good image.', '2005-04-11 14:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
