(1284254, 165103, 12578, '<td valign="top">Your runner is too posed, would have been better had your runner done a couple of meter sprints for each shot you took as the motion blur doesn''t show to me that he is actually moving, maybe its the pose, maybe its the tie?</td>', 'Your runner is too posed, would have been better had your runner done a couple of meter sprints for each shot you took as the motion blur doesn''t show to me that he is actually moving, maybe its the pose, maybe its the tie?', '2005-04-11 14:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
