(1285137, 165032, 22537, '<td valign="top">The complexity of the fire is the strength within this image.  The subjects are well placed within the photo but the background is blah and somewhat distracting.  Great capture nonetheless.  Goodluck!</td>', 'The complexity of the fire is the strength within this image.  The subjects are well placed within the photo but the background is blah and somewhat distracting.  Great capture nonetheless.  Goodluck!', '2005-04-12 00:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
