(1285153, 164900, 22537, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure the sense in this shot and am now chuckling at the sheer  creativity embodied in this photo. I wonder whether color would have strengthened the image but I''m not sure.  This is fresh, funny, quirky and thoughful.  I hope you do very well on those points alone.  Good luck.</td>', 'It took me a while to figure the sense in this shot and am now chuckling at the sheer  creativity embodied in this photo. I wonder whether color would have strengthened the image but I''m not sure.  This is fresh, funny, quirky and thoughful.  I hope you do very well on those points alone.  Good luck.', '2005-04-12 00:32:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1285154, 165123, 13119, '<td valign="top">Not sharp.<br/>Maybe a faster shutter next time</td>', 'Not sharp.Maybe a faster shutter next time', '2005-04-12 00:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
