(1285156, 165103, 22537, '<td valign="top">I like how you''ve created the illusion of movement through blurr.  Smart way to compensate for something which would have been downright reckless.  Interesting image and creatively fresh.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like how you''ve created the illusion of movement through blurr.  Smart way to compensate for something which would have been downright reckless.  Interesting image and creatively fresh.  Good luck!', '2005-04-12 00:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1285157, 163855, 22537, '<td valign="top">I was expecting a number of these shots and will say this is one of the best.  Great compostion and technically crisp.  Good luck!</td>', 'I was expecting a number of these shots and will say this is one of the best.  Great compostion and technically crisp.  Good luck!', '2005-04-12 00:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1285159, 165105, 13119, '<td valign="top">Nice strike.<br/>Be glad you didnt leave the 5 pin.<br/>The end of the lane is crisp but I think it would have been more effective if the pins were captured rather than in motion.<br/>Maybe more of a straight shot down the lane as well.<br/>Not for EXTREME action, lets see a 7-10 pick up</td>', 'Nice strike.Be glad you didnt leave the 5 pin.The end of the lane is crisp but I think it would have been more effective if the pins were captured rather than in motion.Maybe more of a straight shot down the lane as well.Not for EXTREME action, lets see a 7-10 pick up', '2005-04-12 00:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1285161, 165012, 22537, '<td valign="top">Rugby shots seem to work well because they are always intense, colorful and have plenty of agonizing facial expressions to beef up the shot.  This is one of those shots. Good luck with this well captured image!</td>', 'Rugby shots seem to work well because they are always intense, colorful and have plenty of agonizing facial expressions to beef up the shot.  This is one of those shots. Good luck with this well captured image!', '2005-04-12 00:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1285163, 165017, 22537, '<td valign="top">This is not my top pick for excitement but is among the best in presentation.  I''m drawn to the clean feel of the shot.  Hard to put my finger on it but I really like it. Good luck!</td>', 'This is not my top pick for excitement but is among the best in presentation.  I''m drawn to the clean feel of the shot.  Hard to put my finger on it but I really like it. Good luck!', '2005-04-12 00:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
