(1285410, 165069, 34192, '<td valign="top">Rule number 1: NEVER hold your flashlight in front of your body - gives the bad guy with a gun somewhere to aim.  That said,  the image is a touch out of focus, maybe intentional, I don''t know. the crop works, not sure about the color treatment done.  Her flashlight is not aimed the same place as her gun so I believe this is a set up shot.  No points off, just letting you know I noticed. 5</td>', 'Rule number 1: NEVER hold your flashlight in front of your body - gives the bad guy with a gun somewhere to aim.  That said,  the image is a touch out of focus, maybe intentional, I don''t know. the crop works, not sure about the color treatment done.  Her flashlight is not aimed the same place as her gun so I believe this is a set up shot.  No points off, just letting you know I noticed. 5', '2005-04-12 08:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
