(1287386, 164452, 23478, '<td valign="top">I know how you feel...</td>', 'I know how you feel...', '2005-04-13 03:28:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287645, 165072, 23458, '<td valign="top">Given that I can''t make out the cockpit in this image, I''m assuming it''s a toy - it not for that minor detail this would have made a nice illusion. The use of the sun is very effective.</td>', 'Given that I can''t make out the cockpit in this image, I''m assuming it''s a toy - it not for that minor detail this would have made a nice illusion. The use of the sun is very effective.', '2005-04-13 06:05:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1287894, 165186, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice tricolored heron</td>', 'Nice tricolored heron', '2005-04-13 08:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288048, 164797, 35277, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2005-04-13 09:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288062, 164920, 28299, '<td valign="top">Love it! The action, the expressions, the contrast, the urban feel to it ... 10</td>', 'Love it! The action, the expressions, the contrast, the urban feel to it ... 10', '2005-04-13 09:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288463, 164772, 33560, '<td valign="top">It''s not uncommon for images that are blurred to score poorly in DPC challenges, I hope this photo does well.  I happen to like this photo quite a lot.  It inspires me to try night photography agian.</td>', 'It''s not uncommon for images that are blurred to score poorly in DPC challenges, I hope this photo does well.  I happen to like this photo quite a lot.  It inspires me to try night photography agian.', '2005-04-13 11:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288468, 165032, 33560, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  Colorful and unexpected.  I love the composition, color palette, and lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful.  Colorful and unexpected.  I love the composition, color palette, and lighting.', '2005-04-13 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288473, 163858, 33560, '<td valign="top">The idea for the photo is funny.  The implementation strikes me as just a  little over-the-top.</td>', 'The idea for the photo is funny.  The implementation strikes me as just a  little over-the-top.', '2005-04-13 11:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288490, 165192, 33560, '<td valign="top">I like to photograph streams as well.  The most popular idiom for streams is to use really slow film, stop the lens down to f/32 , slap on a neutral filter, set the camera on a lens, expose for several seconds.  Then the smoothe white color of the water really contrasts with the rough texture of the  dark rocks. My own point and shoot won''t let me do this, so I''m wondering whether I should try to photograph streams on brightly lit nights or near dawn or dusk.   You migtht find that the composition feels less static if the stream flows diagonally through the photograph.</td>', 'I like to photograph streams as well.  The most popular idiom for streams is to use really slow film, stop the lens down to f/32 , slap on a neutral filter, set the camera on a lens, expose for several seconds.  Then the smoothe white color of the water really contrasts with the rough texture of the  dark rocks. My own point and shoot won''t let me do this, so I''m wondering whether I should try to photograph streams on brightly lit nights or near dawn or dusk.   You migtht find that the composition feels less static if the stream flows diagonally through the photograph.', '2005-04-13 11:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288493, 165057, 33560, '<td valign="top">Very funny. <br/> <br/>The vast blurry space on the right and the slightly indistinct turtle headed into the blurry wall does not strike me as inspired composition.  Hard to give it poiints commensurate with the genius of its inspiration.</td>', 'Very funny.  The vast blurry space on the right and the slightly indistinct turtle headed into the blurry wall does not strike me as inspired composition.  Hard to give it poiints commensurate with the genius of its inspiration.', '2005-04-13 11:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288579, 165010, 30173, '<td valign="top">Good shot ! I would really like to vote but I''m not a full member yet. Ribbon 4U !!!</td>', 'Good shot ! I would really like to vote but I''m not a full member yet. Ribbon 4U !!!', '2005-04-13 13:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288625, 164434, 33256, '<td valign="top">I would rather see the negative space in front of the skateboarder. As it is my eyes are drawn to the steeple not the action.</td>', 'I would rather see the negative space in front of the skateboarder. As it is my eyes are drawn to the steeple not the action.', '2005-04-13 13:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288680, 165198, 2741, '<td valign="top">This is great!  The facial expressions are awesome. 7</td>', 'This is great!  The facial expressions are awesome. 7', '2005-04-13 13:48:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288693, 165064, 2741, '<td valign="top">Great position on this one. 7.</td>', 'Great position on this one. 7.', '2005-04-13 13:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288717, 164835, 2741, '<td valign="top">Did they find what they were looking for?  LOL.</td>', 'Did they find what they were looking for?  LOL.', '2005-04-13 13:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1288720, 164435, 2741, '<td valign="top">Great shot. 7</td>', 'Great shot. 7', '2005-04-13 13:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
