(1289288, 164797, 31307, '<td valign="top">I think a darker background would have helped keep the soda from blending in.  Cool shot any way, though!</td>', 'I think a darker background would have helped keep the soda from blending in.  Cool shot any way, though!', '2005-04-13 16:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
