(1289303, 164434, 31307, '<td valign="top">The dude''s face looks kind of orange...he doesn''t have jaundice does he?  Might want to see a doctor....<br/> <br/>Also, I''d be interested to know why you cropped the arm off.</td>', 'The dude''s face looks kind of orange...he doesn''t have jaundice does he?  Might want to see a doctor.... Also, I''d be interested to know why you cropped the arm off.', '2005-04-13 16:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
