(1290492, 164856, 20462, '<td valign="top">ahhhhh, i like this picture so much.  I considered doing a golf shot, but now I am glad i did not, because it would have never compared to this professional quality shot.  you must have artificially blurred much of it right?  I am very jealous of your experience.  history really.</td>', 'ahhhhh, i like this picture so much.  I considered doing a golf shot, but now I am glad i did not, because it would have never compared to this professional quality shot.  you must have artificially blurred much of it right?  I am very jealous of your experience.  history really.', '2005-04-13 23:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290729, 165105, 13688, '<td valign="top">I really like the idea for this composition.  What makes me uncomfortable though, is the  bowling ball leading the eye into the frame and then the pins on the right acting like a wall to stop it.  If you could have captured a strike in the other lane perhaps I''d be enjoying this even more, because both the top and bottom elements would be flowing the pic off to the right.   In photoshop, give it a touch more USM or sharpen edges next time.  Sorry for being overly critical.</td>', 'I really like the idea for this composition.  What makes me uncomfortable though, is the  bowling ball leading the eye into the frame and then the pins on the right acting like a wall to stop it.  If you could have captured a strike in the other lane perhaps I''d be enjoying this even more, because both the top and bottom elements would be flowing the pic off to the right.   In photoshop, give it a touch more USM or sharpen edges next time.  Sorry for being overly critical.', '2005-04-14 01:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290744, 165114, 13688, '<td valign="top">Nice detail.  I would have liked to see the background blurred instead of destat.</td>', 'Nice detail.  I would have liked to see the background blurred instead of destat.', '2005-04-14 01:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290826, 165180, 13688, '<td valign="top">Cool photo technique.  The skating looks a bit sketchy.  Show him popping a big ollie and for me this pic would go from a 6 to a 9.</td>', 'Cool photo technique.  The skating looks a bit sketchy.  Show him popping a big ollie and for me this pic would go from a 6 to a 9.', '2005-04-14 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290860, 164630, 13688, '<td valign="top">Wow. Color and movement is amazing.  And the pairing of the upper left art with her expression is the best part.  Perhaps showing the other faces on top would add to it...perhaps you didn''t crop...perhaps it was perfect as is.  Now about that title.....</td>', 'Wow. Color and movement is amazing.  And the pairing of the upper left art with her expression is the best part.  Perhaps showing the other faces on top would add to it...perhaps you didn''t crop...perhaps it was perfect as is.  Now about that title.....', '2005-04-14 02:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290885, 164920, 13688, '<td valign="top">The expressions of the onlookers makes this a masterpiece, but perhaps you already knew that. -10</td>', 'The expressions of the onlookers makes this a masterpiece, but perhaps you already knew that. -10', '2005-04-14 03:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1290898, 164323, 13688, '<td valign="top">Mr. Funk, Your work is usually very intriguing and obviously very stylized.  Not that I''m any one to concern yourself with but I generally really like it or I really don''t.  In this case it feels too static or staged for the action presented, unlike your "Sore Loser" where you conveyed action in stopped motion to perfection. Perhaps spreading the fragments out a bit more or adding some more angle to the broken off piece would jazz things up.   I''ll shut up now as you get your 6+, which seems to easily elude me.  Apparently I have way too much time on my hands tonight...the little sliver to the right seems hard to avoid.  If you aren''t who I thought and this is a real karate chop, I apologize, and I''ll quietly go back to watching late night infomercials instead of making stupid comments.</td>', 'Mr. Funk, Your work is usually very intriguing and obviously very stylized.  Not that I''m any one to concern yourself with but I generally really like it or I really don''t.  In this case it feels too static or staged for the action presented, unlike your "Sore Loser" where you conveyed action in stopped motion to perfection. Perhaps spreading the fragments out a bit more or adding some more angle to the broken off piece would jazz things up.   I''ll shut up now as you get your 6+, which seems to easily elude me.  Apparently I have way too much time on my hands tonight...the little sliver to the right seems hard to avoid.  If you aren''t who I thought and this is a real karate chop, I apologize, and I''ll quietly go back to watching late night infomercials instead of making stupid comments.', '2005-04-14 03:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291008, 165103, 30861, '<td valign="top">This cracks me up. I give you high score for imagination alone in  this one, even though it''s obviously staged. In fact, the staginess is aprt of its charm. I don''t suppose it will do especially well, but I score it high.</td>', 'This cracks me up. I give you high score for imagination alone in  this one, even though it''s obviously staged. In fact, the staginess is aprt of its charm. I don''t suppose it will do especially well, but I score it high.', '2005-04-14 05:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291010, 164238, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is seriously outstanding. I''m not sure if it will meet some peoples'' expectations of "action" , but it''s a contender in my book.</td>', 'This is seriously outstanding. I''m not sure if it will meet some peoples'' expectations of "action" , but it''s a contender in my book.', '2005-04-14 05:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291012, 165012, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding frozen action. facial expressions, position of the ball, are perfect. Lighting accentuates muscles of thigh, perfect. Should do very well.</td>', 'Outstanding frozen action. facial expressions, position of the ball, are perfect. Lighting accentuates muscles of thigh, perfect. Should do very well.', '2005-04-14 05:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291016, 164835, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is the "other" fine rugby picture. There''s one that is a better capture of "action", showing mid-air bodies and a frozen ball, but this one is funny as hell and I''ve no doubt it will make top 10.</td>', 'This is the "other" fine rugby picture. There''s one that is a better capture of "action", showing mid-air bodies and a frozen ball, but this one is funny as hell and I''ve no doubt it will make top 10.', '2005-04-14 05:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291019, 164659, 30861, '<td valign="top">It''s really hard to see this as "action", IMO, but it''s immensely appealing and I score it well. I''d liek it better without the unfortunately-placed BG horse. Good luck with it.</td>', 'It''s really hard to see this as "action", IMO, but it''s immensely appealing and I score it well. I''d liek it better without the unfortunately-placed BG horse. Good luck with it.', '2005-04-14 05:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291020, 165032, 30861, '<td valign="top">A different sort of action. Beautiful image, strong contender.</td>', 'A different sort of action. Beautiful image, strong contender.', '2005-04-14 05:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1291021, 165195, 30861, '<td valign="top">Technically this is no great shakes, but damn, whatta capture. Given the nature of the challenge, i give this a high score. I hope it does well.</td>', 'Technically this is no great shakes, but damn, whatta capture. Given the nature of the challenge, i give this a high score. I hope it does well.', '2005-04-14 05:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
