(1291023, 165128, 30861, '<td valign="top">Outstanding strange. How "real" is that, and I hope you''ve explained it in your notes, it''s fascinating. Feel free to PM me and tell me if you like, I''m done with voting.</td>', 'Outstanding strange. How "real" is that, and I hope you''ve explained it in your notes, it''s fascinating. Feel free to PM me and tell me if you like, I''m done with voting.', '2005-04-14 05:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
