(1291038, 165098, 30861, '<td valign="top">Conceptually and visually this really pleases me. I wish you had better control of your tones though, the burned-out highlights are hurting you.</td>', 'Conceptually and visually this really pleases me. I wish you had better control of your tones though, the burned-out highlights are hurting you.', '2005-04-14 06:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
