(1292320, 165186, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is a very, very good image. Kudos to you for such a spectacular capture. The color in it that is practically screaming to be brought out, particularly the greens and the blues. This is hard for me to score because I feel you are short changing the image a lot by not bringing out its color.  I''m giving it a 7, but has potential to score a lot higher.</td>', 'This is a very, very good image. Kudos to you for such a spectacular capture. The color in it that is practically screaming to be brought out, particularly the greens and the blues. This is hard for me to score because I feel you are short changing the image a lot by not bringing out its color.  I''m giving it a 7, but has potential to score a lot higher.', '2005-04-14 17:28:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292324, 165072, 5792, '<td valign="top">You get credit for making a stationary object almost look like it is moving. Nice composition. :)</td>', 'You get credit for making a stationary object almost look like it is moving. Nice composition. :)', '2005-04-14 17:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292332, 164900, 5792, '<td valign="top">An interesting and creative composition.</td>', 'An interesting and creative composition.', '2005-04-14 17:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292342, 165150, 16636, '<td valign="top">just wonderful - hope you win with this! - 10</td>', 'just wonderful - hope you win with this! - 10', '2005-04-14 17:39:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292343, 165155, 5792, '<td valign="top">Don''t like how the blue sky gives the trees on the horizon a blue tint, but this is a good action shot captured at the perfect moment. I''d recommend cropping a bit more from the top by making the amount of space above the golfer''s head match the distance from the bottom of the club to the bottom of the frame.</td>', 'Don''t like how the blue sky gives the trees on the horizon a blue tint, but this is a good action shot captured at the perfect moment. I''d recommend cropping a bit more from the top by making the amount of space above the golfer''s head match the distance from the bottom of the club to the bottom of the frame.', '2005-04-14 17:40:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292344, 165064, 16636, '<td valign="top">well captured - deserved 10</td>', 'well captured - deserved 10', '2005-04-14 17:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292346, 164217, 16636, '<td valign="top">nicely framed, good simple image  - hoope it does well</td>', 'nicely framed, good simple image  - hoope it does well', '2005-04-14 17:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292349, 164762, 5792, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge. After all, it is extreme for the geriatric set. Good form for an old guy. :)  Nice B&amp;W.<br/></td>', 'Meets the challenge. After all, it is extreme for the geriatric set. Good form for an old guy. :)  Nice B&W.', '2005-04-14 17:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292364, 165125, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great vibe through the processing. The subject is bang-on, but the composition is a tad too tight to the bottom and it is oversharpened. Lighting is clear but it lacks aatmosphere - although this would be a fairly good stock photo for a subject like ''bending over backwards''.<br/> <br/>As an artistic photo, I''m not sure what I think of it really. Its main appeal for me is the tones and definition but the pose doesn''t sit well aesthetically, despite the brilliant athlete involved. I wouldn''t hang it myself, but it''s probably a ribboner though.</td>', 'Great vibe through the processing. The subject is bang-on, but the composition is a tad too tight to the bottom and it is oversharpened. Lighting is clear but it lacks aatmosphere - although this would be a fairly good stock photo for a subject like ''bending over backwards''. As an artistic photo, I''m not sure what I think of it really. Its main appeal for me is the tones and definition but the pose doesn''t sit well aesthetically, despite the brilliant athlete involved. I wouldn''t hang it myself, but it''s probably a ribboner though.', '2005-04-14 17:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1292368, 164762, 8860, '<td valign="top">Isn''t the death rate attributed to sport in old age likely to be high anyway?! Do more people play bowls than any other or is it just too strenuous?<br/>: )</td>', 'Isn''t the death rate attributed to sport in old age likely to be high anyway?! Do more people play bowls than any other or is it just too strenuous?: )', '2005-04-14 17:53:43.000000', NULL, 1),
