(1294694, 165187, 25655, '<td valign="top">A fun shot.<br/>I love the expression on the girl''s face. This alone hints the extreme feeling. 8</td>', 'A fun shot.I love the expression on the girl''s face. This alone hints the extreme feeling. 8', '2005-04-15 19:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294702, 165032, 25655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!<br/>The man''s face are so clear and sharp, and I like the the fire''s reflection on them.<br/>The warm colors are also adding to that mystery feeling that is surrounding the circus people so often.<br/>I wish the background had been darker though. I think it would give some more "air" to the fire to burn to perfection. 8<br/></td>', 'Beautiful!The man''s face are so clear and sharp, and I like the the fire''s reflection on them.The warm colors are also adding to that mystery feeling that is surrounding the circus people so often.I wish the background had been darker though. I think it would give some more "air" to the fire to burn to perfection. 8', '2005-04-15 19:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294704, 165201, 25655, '<td valign="top">the player''s expression and the hand just say it all.<br/>Great action shot!</td>', 'the player''s expression and the hand just say it all.Great action shot!', '2005-04-15 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294708, 164390, 25655, '<td valign="top">The perspective is great!!<br/>I like the bluriness of the ball, the expression on the kid''s face, the composition.<br/>Not too extreme but a wonderful action shot.</td>', 'The perspective is great!!I like the bluriness of the ball, the expression on the kid''s face, the composition.Not too extreme but a wonderful action shot.', '2005-04-15 19:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294712, 165010, 25655, '<td valign="top">Just for calidation I''m bumping this one up!<br/>Great catch and I love the silhouette against those dramatic sky!</td>', 'Just for calidation I''m bumping this one up!Great catch and I love the silhouette against those dramatic sky!', '2005-04-15 19:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
