(1294953, 164835, 33542, '<td valign="top">See now, THAT''S why it''s important to wear underwear while playing rugby. Incidentally, that red player is way too small to try to tackle around the chest, he really needs to go for the legs. What is he, the scrumhalf?</td>', 'See now, THAT''S why it''s important to wear underwear while playing rugby. Incidentally, that red player is way too small to try to tackle around the chest, he really needs to go for the legs. What is he, the scrumhalf?', '2005-04-15 23:05:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1294959, 165015, 33542, '<td valign="top">Ouch, that looks terrible.</td>', 'Ouch, that looks terrible.', '2005-04-15 23:07:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295096, 164323, 6668, '<td valign="top">Very nice, love the wood fragments, nicely done!</td>', 'Very nice, love the wood fragments, nicely done!', '2005-04-16 00:33:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295099, 165015, 6668, '<td valign="top">OMG...that''s even painful just to look at...OUCH!!</td>', 'OMG...that''s even painful just to look at...OUCH!!', '2005-04-16 00:39:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295604, 164997, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting take on "extreme action"; I was underwhelmed at first, but I keep coming back to it and I''ve bumped it up two  levels.  I like the gritty "accidental" tone of the image, and it''s in many ways quite a penetrating take on the challenge. I hope it does better than I supect it will.</td>', 'This is an interesting take on "extreme action"; I was underwhelmed at first, but I keep coming back to it and I''ve bumped it up two  levels.  I like the gritty "accidental" tone of the image, and it''s in many ways quite a penetrating take on the challenge. I hope it does better than I supect it will.', '2005-04-16 04:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295605, 165150, 30861, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. I like it better each time I look at it. The title is sort of dragging it down, IMO. I also have a nasty suspicion that this is THE "damned beach", or nearby it, coastal Oregon. Damned beach! So if that''s zoomer or charlie doing this paragliding, well then damn, I knew it! regardless, a good entry and a totally different "look" from the rest of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot. I like it better each time I look at it. The title is sort of dragging it down, IMO. I also have a nasty suspicion that this is THE "damned beach", or nearby it, coastal Oregon. Damned beach! So if that''s zoomer or charlie doing this paragliding, well then damn, I knew it! regardless, a good entry and a totally different "look" from the rest of the challenge.', '2005-04-16 04:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295607, 165088, 30861, '<td valign="top">Bleak is fun? Welcome to Iceland!</td>', 'Bleak is fun? Welcome to Iceland!', '2005-04-16 04:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295608, 165010, 30861, '<td valign="top">This is really strong. We don''t see a lot of true high contrast work in here, and this stans out wonderfully. certainly, it''s extreme action.</td>', 'This is really strong. We don''t see a lot of true high contrast work in here, and this stans out wonderfully. certainly, it''s extreme action.', '2005-04-16 04:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295611, 165180, 30861, '<td valign="top">a nice mood to this one, it''s graphically very strong. doesn''t really speak tot he challenge for me, but it''s a good photo and i give it a decent score.</td>', 'a nice mood to this one, it''s graphically very strong. doesn''t really speak tot he challenge for me, but it''s a good photo and i give it a decent score.', '2005-04-16 04:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295617, 165098, 24495, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Picture of Happy go Lucky!</td>', 'Beautiful Picture of Happy go Lucky!', '2005-04-16 04:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295672, 164436, 18450, '<td valign="top">WOW!! Nice shot!!!!</td>', 'WOW!! Nice shot!!!!', '2005-04-16 06:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295679, 163858, 18450, '<td valign="top">Any ironing is extreme!!!! Creative concept, would have liked to have seen the iron in focus I think</td>', 'Any ironing is extreme!!!! Creative concept, would have liked to have seen the iron in focus I think', '2005-04-16 06:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1295802, 165017, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great action and capture. I''d like to have seen this in portrait format with the whole shadow.</td>', 'Great action and capture. I''d like to have seen this in portrait format with the whole shadow.', '2005-04-16 08:12:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296437, 163809, 36543, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo, but I have to ask what is it?  Were there any post edits? Any filters?  I love natural patterns.  This one gets my vote! :)<br/></td>', 'This is a really great photo, but I have to ask what is it?  Were there any post edits? Any filters?  I love natural patterns.  This one gets my vote! :)', '2005-04-16 14:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296486, 165121, 8860, '<td valign="top">A very unaesthetic background but an excellent piece of stopped motion. Beautiful creature at full stretch, showing lots of muscular tension.</td>', 'A very unaesthetic background but an excellent piece of stopped motion. Beautiful creature at full stretch, showing lots of muscular tension.', '2005-04-16 15:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296488, 164713, 8860, '<td valign="top">Dull conditions but a technically proficient shot. I''d like to see the composition tighter to the car though, as there''s not much need for the extra context. The action is not so extreme either, but more ordinary speed.</td>', 'Dull conditions but a technically proficient shot. I''d like to see the composition tighter to the car though, as there''s not much need for the extra context. The action is not so extreme either, but more ordinary speed.', '2005-04-16 15:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296490, 164429, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - framing could have been better, with more of the bowl and and a tighter crop on the right (less bland sky).</td>', 'Nice capture - framing could have been better, with more of the bowl and and a tighter crop on the right (less bland sky).', '2005-04-16 15:12:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296573, 165103, 16046, '<td valign="top">Good job with the motion blur, if only you could have done something with his hair it would be perfect. 8</td>', 'Good job with the motion blur, if only you could have done something with his hair it would be perfect. 8', '2005-04-16 16:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296575, 165064, 16046, '<td valign="top">That green water is awesome. great action, bumping up to a 9</td>', 'That green water is awesome. great action, bumping up to a 9', '2005-04-16 16:27:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296590, 164838, 16046, '<td valign="top">if it wasn''t resting on the post it would be perfect, great stock photo shot. Hard to find action in this one though. 7</td>', 'if it wasn''t resting on the post it would be perfect, great stock photo shot. Hard to find action in this one though. 7', '2005-04-16 16:39:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1296592, 164435, 16046, '<td valign="top">second best surf shot, very good 8</td>', 'second best surf shot, very good 8', '2005-04-16 16:41:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296593, 165125, 27482, '<td valign="top">Looks severely oversharpened, at least on my screen but other than that pretty good shot.  I can´t help but wonder what it would have looked like with a natural backround, like a meadow or something but it works like it is.  Great job.</td>', 'Looks severely oversharpened, at least on my screen but other than that pretty good shot.  I can´t help but wonder what it would have looked like with a natural backround, like a meadow or something but it works like it is.  Great job.', '2005-04-16 16:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296730, 164856, 3306, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition. I can definitely appreciate the connotation of Extreme Action in his swing. No one gets the club speed that tiger gets.</td>', 'Excellent composition. I can definitely appreciate the connotation of Extreme Action in his swing. No one gets the club speed that tiger gets.', '2005-04-16 18:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296732, 164802, 3306, '<td valign="top">Great stop action. Terrific color and feeling of motion. Very good submission for this challenge.</td>', 'Great stop action. Terrific color and feeling of motion. Very good submission for this challenge.', '2005-04-16 19:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296855, 164856, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great shot, I hope you made some money from selling this shot to the papers.<br/>Well deserved 10</td>', 'Great shot, I hope you made some money from selling this shot to the papers.Well deserved 10', '2005-04-16 20:11:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296856, 164920, 18080, '<td valign="top">10<br/>great shot<br/>fantastic expression<br/>good luck</td>', '10great shotfantastic expressiongood luck', '2005-04-16 20:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296858, 165010, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great image<br/>10</td>', 'Great image10', '2005-04-16 20:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296860, 164434, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great shot<br/>9<br/>good luck</td>', 'Great shot9good luck', '2005-04-16 20:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296865, 163991, 18080, '<td valign="top">Great movment captured with this shot<br/>9<br/>good luck</td>', 'Great movment captured with this shot9good luck', '2005-04-16 20:13:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296991, 165120, 28141, '<td valign="top">Shooting at this angle would make it look cool (like he was getting serious air), but you''d need to do it in such a way that the background isn''t visible.  The trees and guys on the other ramp ruin the effect.</td>', 'Shooting at this angle would make it look cool (like he was getting serious air), but you''d need to do it in such a way that the background isn''t visible.  The trees and guys on the other ramp ruin the effect.', '2005-04-16 21:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1296997, 165032, 28141, '<td valign="top">The fire is a neat capture, but I don''t see a lot of action.  He seems like he''s standing still, just kindof looking at the fire.</td>', 'The fire is a neat capture, but I don''t see a lot of action.  He seems like he''s standing still, just kindof looking at the fire.', '2005-04-16 21:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297004, 165128, 28141, '<td valign="top">The fuzziness on the wings is sort of unsettling...it doesn''t really look like a motion blur...maybe a wierd reflection.  Whatever it is, it ditracts from the rest of the plane.</td>', 'The fuzziness on the wings is sort of unsettling...it doesn''t really look like a motion blur...maybe a wierd reflection.  Whatever it is, it ditracts from the rest of the plane.', '2005-04-16 21:28:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297005, 164879, 28141, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing the action...she looks like she''s just lying there...<br/> <br/>I guess I also don''t see being baptized as extreme.  It seems like more of a calm and happy sort of action to me.  I guess maybe if you''re converting religions after a long period of being devoted to another, but the image doesn''t really convey a major conversion to me...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-04-22 10:30:49.</i></td>', 'I''m not seeing the action...she looks like she''s just lying there... I guess I also don''t see being baptized as extreme.  It seems like more of a calm and happy sort of action to me.  I guess maybe if you''re converting religions after a long period of being devoted to another, but the image doesn''t really convey a major conversion to me...', '2005-04-16 21:29:17.000000', '2005-04-22 11:30:49.000000', 1),
(1297009, 165105, 28141, '<td valign="top">The strike should be the center of attention in this image, but the mural above it is so bright and crisp that it dominates over everything else.</td>', 'The strike should be the center of attention in this image, but the mural above it is so bright and crisp that it dominates over everything else.', '2005-04-16 21:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297017, 165052, 35321, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, though I''d like to see the subject a bit closer.   Cropping some off the right and bottom might help. That''s one level horizon! :-)</td>', 'Nice shot, though I''d like to see the subject a bit closer.   Cropping some off the right and bottom might help. That''s one level horizon! :-)', '2005-04-16 21:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297030, 164802, 35321, '<td valign="top">Great technique, vivid colors, and fits the topic perfectly.  Outstanding capture of a moment in time.</td>', 'Great technique, vivid colors, and fits the topic perfectly.  Outstanding capture of a moment in time.', '2005-04-16 21:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297057, 164695, 35321, '<td valign="top">Weeee!!  :-)  The bookshelf draws attention away from the subject a little, though the lighting helps to keep the focus on the subject.</td>', 'Weeee!!  :-)  The bookshelf draws attention away from the subject a little, though the lighting helps to keep the focus on the subject.', '2005-04-16 21:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297069, 165085, 35321, '<td valign="top">Great use of slow shutter speed--shows motion, yet not so overdone that you can''t see the players'' facial expressions.</td>', 'Great use of slow shutter speed--shows motion, yet not so overdone that you can''t see the players'' facial expressions.', '2005-04-16 22:06:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297101, 164758, 35321, '<td valign="top">Lots going on in this one!   Getting in close and focusing on just a few geese might be helpful.</td>', 'Lots going on in this one!   Getting in close and focusing on just a few geese might be helpful.', '2005-04-16 22:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297116, 165155, 31213, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot!  Love the angle, and idea.  Well done.</td>', 'Very cool shot!  Love the angle, and idea.  Well done.', '2005-04-16 22:23:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297138, 165032, 35321, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Best use of framing I''ve seen in a long time. ;-)</td>', 'Wow.  Best use of framing I''ve seen in a long time. ;-)', '2005-04-16 22:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297145, 165115, 35321, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of desaturation to focus on the subject.  You could probably get by with cropping off almost the entire left half.</td>', 'Interesting use of desaturation to focus on the subject.  You could probably get by with cropping off almost the entire left half.', '2005-04-16 22:34:45.000000', NULL, 1),
