(1297711, 164835, 34192, '<td valign="top">Love the color and the detail in this image.  Excellent timing.  People go on and on about the rule of thirds and centering but don''t believe it.  I think this is great and well done exactly as composed and cropped.  9 from me!</td>', 'Love the color and the detail in this image.  Excellent timing.  People go on and on about the rule of thirds and centering but don''t believe it.  I think this is great and well done exactly as composed and cropped.  9 from me!', '2005-04-17 10:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
