(1297820, 164234, 7560, '<td valign="top">This shot just screams for a different background. With a less busy backdrop this is a 10. as is, I love the motion in this shot. It is also nicely metaphorical for the motion of our world as it spins by. One of my favorites this challenge. 8<br/></td>', 'This shot just screams for a different background. With a less busy backdrop this is a 10. as is, I love the motion in this shot. It is also nicely metaphorical for the motion of our world as it spins by. One of my favorites this challenge. 8', '2005-04-17 12:59:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297825, 164856, 7560, '<td valign="top">Nice seats! Good sports shot, but almost too shallow on the DOF. I think the lack of focus on the arms is a bit of a problem. It may not be the intent-but this ends up feeling less like a natural camera effect and more like overly post processed. Regardless- and excellent photojournalism style shot. 8</td>', 'Nice seats! Good sports shot, but almost too shallow on the DOF. I think the lack of focus on the arms is a bit of a problem. It may not be the intent-but this ends up feeling less like a natural camera effect and more like overly post processed. Regardless- and excellent photojournalism style shot. 8', '2005-04-17 13:10:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297826, 165155, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great action shot. Little contrasty, probably due to time fo day. But you did an excellent job catching the feeling of motion. A little dodge on the face to brighten it up might help some. Then again, it might not. :) 8</td>', 'Great action shot. Little contrasty, probably due to time fo day. But you did an excellent job catching the feeling of motion. A little dodge on the face to brighten it up might help some. Then again, it might not. :) 8', '2005-04-17 13:11:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1297831, 164238, 7560, '<td valign="top">Great moment! Excellent detail, the only quibble would be darn I wish that bear was facing you! This has some possible stock potential. Great job. 8</td>', 'Great moment! Excellent detail, the only quibble would be darn I wish that bear was facing you! This has some possible stock potential. Great job. 8', '2005-04-17 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
