(1299225, 165128, 16230, '<td valign="top">Great capture David! This should have done much better. Obviously, not many of the voters (or commentors anyway) know much about jets and aerodynamics. The vortices over the wing, and especially the wing tip vortices, make this shot what it is. Without them it would just be an F-15 hanging in the air. Oh well... better luck next time. :)</td>', 'Great capture David! This should have done much better. Obviously, not many of the voters (or commentors anyway) know much about jets and aerodynamics. The vortices over the wing, and especially the wing tip vortices, make this shot what it is. Without them it would just be an F-15 hanging in the air. Oh well... better luck next time. :)', '2005-04-18 02:28:55.000000', NULL, 0),
