(1299683, 164238, 27812, '<td valign="top">Shot with my Sigma 55-200mm, a lens that continues to surprise me.<br/> <br/>Thanks to everyone who turned this into a highlight for me.<br/> <br/>Graphicfunk,Goodman, Artan... and someone who gave me hope right in the beginning when I really needed it, wonder if he remembers, Eric Limon... you are as special as you are.<br/> <br/>But the dedication goes to a little Korean, Yang Yun-Sun, Yunsi, this one is yours!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-16 22:55:01.</i></td>', 'Shot with my Sigma 55-200mm, a lens that continues to surprise me. Thanks to everyone who turned this into a highlight for me. Graphicfunk,Goodman, Artan... and someone who gave me hope right in the beginning when I really needed it, wonder if he remembers, Eric Limon... you are as special as you are. But the dedication goes to a little Korean, Yang Yun-Sun, Yunsi, this one is yours!', '2005-04-18 07:59:44.000000', '2005-05-16 23:55:01.000000', 0),
