(1299689, 165012, 10047, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by saiphfire:</b></div><hr/><i> That tackle is a little high... aim for the thighs!  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yep, the Sir didn''t call the first few high tackles and then it got out of hand. I went in for the 2nd half and ended up getting smacked in the face three times.</td>', 'Originally posted by saiphfire: That tackle is a little high... aim for the thighs!  :)   Yep, the Sir didn''t call the first few high tackles and then it got out of hand. I went in for the 2nd half and ended up getting smacked in the face three times.', '2005-04-18 08:05:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1299690, 165012, 10047, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ltsimring:</b></div><hr/><i> great capture! colors seem a tad on a reddish side </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>We were all sunburnt. It was the first full day of sunny weather, and we were a bit pasty to begin with. After three matches, everything was red.</td>', 'Originally posted by ltsimring: great capture! colors seem a tad on a reddish side   We were all sunburnt. It was the first full day of sunny weather, and we were a bit pasty to begin with. After three matches, everything was red.', '2005-04-18 08:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1299691, 164802, 36231, '<td valign="top">I gave you an 8 - I knew it was awesome! :)  Congrats, and hopefully someday I will be as "extreme" as you!</td>', 'I gave you an 8 - I knew it was awesome! :)  Congrats, and hopefully someday I will be as "extreme" as you!', '2005-04-18 08:07:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(1299694, 165012, 10047, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Cutter:</b></div><hr/><i> where are the pads.  And why does the football have an advertisment on it.  this is a cool shot, and would have benefited from a little less cropping.  But i like it overall </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I wear very thin shoulder pads, but just because I''m an old fart. These young guys haven''t experienced the thrill of seperating shoulders yet.</td>', 'Originally posted by Cutter: where are the pads.  And why does the football have an advertisment on it.  this is a cool shot, and would have benefited from a little less cropping.  But i like it overall   I wear very thin shoulder pads, but just because I''m an old fart. These young guys haven''t experienced the thrill of seperating shoulders yet.', '2005-04-18 08:08:54.000000', NULL, 0),
