(1299750, 165015, 6130, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> Mona you didn''t have to go and cut yourself just for a photo! </i></td></tr></table> <br/>I didn´t cut myself I cut my son David instead. No, this is after his knee operation. They fix a hurt from the football, but I am a little blue yellow and green on my leg because I fell on a sharp stone when I was in the woods and take photos on Elks. You have to do everything for the art.</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: Mona you didn''t have to go and cut yourself just for a photo!  I didn´t cut myself I cut my son David instead. No, this is after his knee operation. They fix a hurt from the football, but I am a little blue yellow and green on my leg because I fell on a sharp stone when I was in the woods and take photos on Elks. You have to do everything for the art.', '2005-04-18 08:46:05.000000', NULL, 0),
