(1302139, 164838, 23456, '<td valign="top">Thankyou to all who commented, means a lot. You all saw how this fitted the challenge like I did, but there were so many others I''d say looking for movemement in the photo or were simply anti-gun. Extreme action has so many interpretations . But going with the obvious in  a lot of the challenges maybe the way to go in future. Going outside the circle and still meeting the challenge still isn''t enough.</td>', 'Thankyou to all who commented, means a lot. You all saw how this fitted the challenge like I did, but there were so many others I''d say looking for movemement in the photo or were simply anti-gun. Extreme action has so many interpretations . But going with the obvious in  a lot of the challenges maybe the way to go in future. Going outside the circle and still meeting the challenge still isn''t enough.', '2005-04-19 00:09:09.000000', NULL, 0),
