(1306295, 165128, 33362, '<td valign="top">I guess the plane was very close since you got it with 135mm lens. It is very nice shot however it seems a bit over processed. Something feels unnatural but I could be wrong.<br/>Did you see Maverick with his hair on fire?</td>', 'I guess the plane was very close since you got it with 135mm lens. It is very nice shot however it seems a bit over processed. Something feels unnatural but I could be wrong.Did you see Maverick with his hair on fire?', '2005-04-19 23:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
