(1402256, 164429, 24613, '<td valign="top">I didn''t enter this challenge because I''m not much of an action photographer (besides, my camera has a hard time stopping a snail).  I would have given this at least an 8 - I think you did a wonderful job freezing the moment.  Nice work!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-05-21 10:57:48.</i></td>', 'I didn''t enter this challenge because I''m not much of an action photographer (besides, my camera has a hard time stopping a snail).  I would have given this at least an 8 - I think you did a wonderful job freezing the moment.  Nice work!', '2005-05-21 11:57:25.000000', '2005-05-21 11:57:48.000000', 0),
(1426353, 165088, 19746, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see either more motion blur or no motion blur at all.  Regardless, this is a fantastically crisp shot, great execution and nicely composed.  It looks very professional indeed.<br/> <br/>Great shot!<br/> <br/>Alex</td>', 'I would have liked to see either more motion blur or no motion blur at all.  Regardless, this is a fantastically crisp shot, great execution and nicely composed.  It looks very professional indeed. Great shot! Alex', '2005-06-01 14:21:57.000000', NULL, 0),
