(1558910, 165187, 15711, '<td valign="top">I just found this.  What a wonderful capture.  Her expression is that split second never again one.  I love it.  The motion, the mood - all evoked perfectly.  Nice use of sepia.  My only critique might be to soften so much of the brightness, but that might ruin it altogether.  Good job.</td>', 'I just found this.  What a wonderful capture.  Her expression is that split second never again one.  I love it.  The motion, the mood - all evoked perfectly.  Nice use of sepia.  My only critique might be to soften so much of the brightness, but that might ruin it altogether.  Good job.', '2005-07-24 15:11:13.000000', NULL, 0),
