(1881624, 164429, 41066, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  I think it is incredible when someone manages to capture a split moment in time like this.  The only thing I would suggest to improve it is probably to clone out some of the smaller things in the background so that it doesn''t look so busy.  I would also increase your curves a bit to make it really pop out at you.  Fantastic action shot.</td>', 'I really like this shot.  I think it is incredible when someone manages to capture a split moment in time like this.  The only thing I would suggest to improve it is probably to clone out some of the smaller things in the background so that it doesn''t look so busy.  I would also increase your curves a bit to make it really pop out at you.  Fantastic action shot.', '2005-11-18 22:51:23.000000', NULL, 0),
