(1962718, 163567, 45717, '<td valign="top">ok, <br/> <br/>nice color, great light, nice texture, b&amp;w good, nice lines, however, there is another pix in this challenge that has trees that shows the ''collection'' aspect of this challenge. I''m sorry to say, I don''t get that impression with this pix. It looks like you opened the back door to your house and took a quick snap shot of the fist thing you saw.</td>', 'ok,  nice color, great light, nice texture, b&w good, nice lines, however, there is another pix in this challenge that has trees that shows the ''collection'' aspect of this challenge. I''m sorry to say, I don''t get that impression with this pix. It looks like you opened the back door to your house and took a quick snap shot of the fist thing you saw.', '2005-12-19 13:01:41.000000', NULL, 0),
