(2826926, 164835, 39209, '<td valign="top">Great shot. I have tried to get some good shots of teenager sons rugby games and found it a lot harder that it would seem. Players are always facing the wrong way or some one runs in front of camera and mucks up focus at the that crucial second and I miss the great shot, so appreciate a good shot when I see one.</td>', 'Great shot. I have tried to get some good shots of teenager sons rugby games and found it a lot harder that it would seem. Players are always facing the wrong way or some one runs in front of camera and mucks up focus at the that crucial second and I miss the great shot, so appreciate a good shot when I see one.', '2006-09-12 08:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
